            | MetronomeNoWorkReplayObligationDeferredExtendedDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkNativeWakeBindingProbeGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkReplayObligationRichStaleDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkCycleBreakPoisonLiveTailDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkJpWaitLiveFrameDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkIdleCrossKindPendingFenceDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkIdleCrossKindRichStaleRetryGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkIdleCrossKindTySidecarActiveDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkLateRaceFreshRootWitnessDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkSemanticRootCompleteRecentDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkSemanticStaleRetargetDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkLateRaceTinyReplayDripImmatureDrainGrace
            | MetronomeNoWorkIdleCrossKindRetryExhaustedAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkIdleCrossKindTySidecarFrozenAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkSemanticStaleRetargetShadowTimeoutPierceAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkSemanticStaleRetargetExhaustedAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkCycleBreakPoisonLiveTailExhaustedAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkReplayObligationDeferredExtendedTerminalDripAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkReplayObligationDeferredExtendedQuietAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkReplayObligationExtendedFrozenAuthorityAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkReplayObligationMidAuthorityFrozenAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkDynamicRecordKeyBridgeFrozenAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkTySidecarPrefetchFrozenAbort
            | MetronomeNoWorkStackFenceShadowTimeoutFrozenAbort
