            | IVarDynamicRecordKeyBridgeCommit of origin: string
            | IVarParentReplayPoisonLiveTail of origin: string
            | IVarParentReplayCycleBreakPoisonImmediateFill of origin: string
            | IVarCrossKindYieldThrashHardPoison of origin: string
            | IVarHardPoisonObligationCap of origin: string
